<h1>Agents Overview</h1>

<p>
    Agents are <strong>mini-automations</strong> that you set up once and then run with a single click or a short chat request. They help you send consistent emails, open the right pages, and kick off common workflows without re-typing the same steps every time. You do not need to write code to build an agent.
</p>

