<h2>Common Agent Examples</h2>

<p>
    Here are some examples of useful agents you might create:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Welcome Email</strong> – Sends a welcome email to new clients with onboarding information</li>
    <li><strong>Renewal Reminder</strong> – Sends reminder emails to clients about upcoming renewals</li>
    <li><strong>Request Loss Runs</strong> – Automatically requests loss runs from carriers for renewals</li>
    <li><strong>Send Payment Link</strong> – Creates and sends payment links to clients</li>
    <li><strong>Certificate Request</strong> – Opens the certificate request form for a specific client</li>
    <li><strong>Policy Summary</strong> – Generates and emails a policy summary to clients</li>
</ul>

<p>
    These are just examples—you can create agents for any repetitive task in your workflow.
</p>

