<h2>How Agents Work with AI Chat</h2>

<p>
    Enhanced AI Chat can automatically route requests to the right agent:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Natural language</strong> – Type what you want in plain English (e.g., "Send loss run requests for Acme")</li>
    <li><strong>Automatic routing</strong> – Chat identifies which agent can handle your request</li>
    <li><strong>Parameter extraction</strong> – Chat extracts the necessary information (client name, policy, etc.) from your message</li>
    <li><strong>Confirmation</strong> – Chat may ask for clarification if information is missing</li>
    <li><strong>Execution</strong> – The agent runs automatically once all parameters are confirmed</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This makes agents even easier to use—you don't need to remember agent names or find buttons; just ask in chat.
</p>

