<h2>Agent Zones</h2>

<p>
    Zones determine where agents appear in the interface:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Client Pages</strong> – Agents that work with client data appear on client record pages</li>
    <li><strong>Renewal Pages</strong> – Agents related to renewals appear on renewal detail pages</li>
    <li><strong>Policy Lists</strong> – Agents that work with policies appear on policy list pages</li>
    <li><strong>Task Boards</strong> – Agents related to tasks appear on task boards</li>
    <li><strong>Other zones</strong> – Additional zones may be available depending on your workflow</li>
</ul>

<p>
    When creating an agent, assign it to the zones where it makes the most sense. Agents can appear in multiple zones if they're relevant to different contexts.
</p>

