<h2>Getting Started</h2>

<p>
    To create your first agent:
</p>

<ol>
    <li>Think of a task you do repeatedly (like sending welcome emails or requesting loss runs)</li>
    <li>Go to <strong>Profile → Custom Agents</strong></li>
    <li>Click <strong>Create New</strong></li>
    <li>Give it a clear name and description</li>
    <li>Add the parameters it needs (see <a href="/help/Agents/parameters">Parameters</a> help)</li>
    <li>Configure the actions it will perform (see <a href="/help/Agents/actions">Actions</a> help)</li>
    <li>Assign it to appropriate zones</li>
    <li>Test it to make sure it works</li>
    <li>Publish it and start using it!</li>
</ol>

<p>
    Don't worry about making it perfect the first time—you can always edit and improve agents as you use them.
</p>

